#1200
@WThe @BHa@Cll @Wof @RSe@Wrv@Bic@Ce@n~
This circular chamber serves as the formal heart of the immortal staff.
A broad oak table fills the center beneath suspended witchlights, with
high-backed chairs reserved for those entrusted with the care of the
realm. Brass plaques record standing duties rather than titles of
vanity: stewardship, building, player assistance, justice, and world
maintenance. Subtle red, white, and blue enamel borders the old service
standard behind the chair of the presiding immortal. Nothing here
suggests that immortality is a reward without obligation. It is a
privilege granted to those trusted to work for the MUD.
~
