Copies of notices, player-facing discussions, and public records are
gathered here so immortals can remain aware of the mortal side of the
realm without intruding unnecessarily. The room is arranged as an
archive rather than a throne room: long reading tables, labeled shelves,
and a quiet place to understand what players are seeing before staff act
on their behalf. The eastern staff complex lies to the north.
~
