Heavy writing tables, map cases, reference shelves, wax tablets, and
pinned duty notices turn this chamber into a practical workroom for the
immortal staff. Builders can compare notes before touching a live zone,
administrators can leave operational guidance, and new immortals can
review current procedures. Nothing here replaces HELP, STAT, REFERENCES,
or the Builder Academy. It exists to remind staff to inspect first,
understand second, and change only what they intend.
~
