@WThe @CMo@Brt@Cal @WPe@Brs@Cpe@Wct@Biv@Ce@n~
This quiet gallery is maintained to keep staff perspective anchored on
the people who actually inhabit and play the world. Public concerns,
recurring questions, and player-facing information can be reviewed here
without treating mortals as abstractions. The purpose is simple:
immortals have greater authority because they have greater
responsibility, not because ordinary players matter less.
~
